Punning Details:
- ‘shi 十 ten’ different things which convey the inscriptions of auspicious sayings, the achievement of which combinatorially result in a perfect life. ‘shi 十 ten ’, is a pun on ‘shi quan 十全 the set of ten situations which result in a perfect life’, which are:
1. A small investment brings in ten-thousand fold profit;
2. Two hearts beat as one;
3. One comes out first in all the three rounds of civil examinations;
4. Peace prevails throughout all the four seasons of the year;
5. Bumper harvest of all the five kinds of important cereals is reaped;
6. Spring permeates all the six directions;
7. The wife and children are all around;
8. The Eight Immortals come to congratulate on one’s birthday;
9. Nine generations live peacefully;
10 The Ten Perfection is achieved and one enjoys wealth and privilege;

